72	/// Thread-safe overlay for injected env vars (secrets loaded from DB).
73	///
74	/// Used by `inject_llm_keys_from_secrets()` to make API keys available to
75	/// `optional_env()` without unsafe `set_var` calls. `optional_env()` checks
76	/// real env vars first, then falls back to this overlay.
77	///
78	/// Uses `Mutex<HashMap>` instead of `OnceLock` so that both
79	/// `inject_os_credentials()` and `inject_llm_keys_from_secrets()` can merge
80	/// their data. Whichever runs first initialises the map; the second merges in.
81	static INJECTED_VARS: LazyLock<Mutex<HashMap<String, String>>> =
82	    LazyLock::new(|| Mutex::new(HashMap::new()));
83	static WARNED_EXPLICIT_DEFAULT_OWNER_ID: Once = Once::new();
