1	//! Application builder for initializing core IronClaw components.
2	//!
3	//! Extracts the mechanical initialization phases from `main.rs` into a
4	//! reusable builder so that:
5	//!
6	//! - Tests can construct a full `AppComponents` without wiring channels
7	//! - Main stays focused on CLI dispatch and channel setup
8	//! - Each init phase is independently testable
9	
